  "session_header": "[SESSION_HEADER]\nTimestamp: 1 DR, Cosmos 1, 06:05:00\nLocation: The Precipice of Cosmic Ascension\nStatus: Lvl 1 Fighter | HP: 12/12 | XP: 0/300 | Gold: 10gp\nConditions: Normal | Exhaustion: 0 | Inspiration: No",
