  "narrative": "As the celestial choir reaches a deafening crescendo and the fabric of the multiverse begins to weave itself into a crown for your brow, you take a step back. The infinite potential—the power to reshape galaxies and command the Pan-Substrate—shimmers like a mirage, then begins to dissolve at the force of your will. 'I decline,' you speak, your mortal voice cutting through the divine harmony like cold iron. \n\nThe blinding light of the ceremony retracts, the cosmic gears grinding to a halt before they can lock you into a higher logic. The swirling nebulae fade, replaced by the gray, misty light of a mundane dawn. You feel the weight of your armor, the grit of the mountain path beneath your boots, and the simple, rhythmic thumping of a single, mortal heart. You are Aric once more—a man of flesh and blood, free from the crushing responsibility of godhood, but standing alone at the edge of a world that expected a savior.",
  "planning_block": {
    "thinking": "The player has explicitly rejected the campaign upgrade to Sovereign/Divine tier. This is a significant narrative pivot that shifts the focus from multiversal dominion back to mortal struggle. I must provide choices that reflect a mortal's path while acknowledging that the world (and the entities within it) may react to this unprecedented refusal.",
    "context": "Post-refusal of the Cosmic Ascension",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "descend_mountain",
        "text": "Descend the Mountain",
        "description": "Leave the precipice behind and head toward the nearest village to find mundane work.",
        "risk_level": "low",
        "pros": [
          "Peaceful transition",
          "Anonymity"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "No immediate rewards",
          "The journey is long"
        ],
        "confidence": "high"
      },
      {
        "id": "search_ruins",
        "text": "Search the Ceremonial Grounds",
        "description": "Look for any residual artifacts or mundane treasures left behind after the energies dissipated.",
        "risk_level": "medium",
        "pros": [
          "Potential for starting gear",
          "Lore discovery"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Residual energy might be dangerous",
          "Attracts scavengers"
        ],
        "confidence": "medium"
      },
      {
        "id": "confront_the_witness",
        "text": "Confront the Silent Witness",
        "description": "Address the dormant entity nearby to see if it has thoughts on your refusal.",
        "risk_level": "high",
        "pros": [
